---
// No props — static content
---

<header class="hero container">
  <div class="hero__inner">
    <p class="hero__greeting">Hi, I'm Simon.</p>

    <!--
      Option B: "Websites and web apps, built properly. Simple landing pages to
      full applications with AI features and custom integrations. I've built for
      my own projects too, so I understand what shipping under real constraints looks like."

      Option C: "Most of what I build falls somewhere between 'we just need a site'
      and 'we need something custom.' I work across that whole range — and because I
      build my own products too, I understand the difference between building
      something and actually using it."

      Chosen — Option A:
    -->
    <p class="hero__bio">
      I build websites and web apps — from quick marketing sites to custom applications
      with forms, dashboards, and AI features. I'm a founder myself, so I know what
      it means to actually ship.
    </p>

    <div class="hero__accent-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 12vw, 9rem) clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .hero__inner {
    max-width: 44ch;
  }

  .hero__greeting {
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero__bio {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero__accent-line {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 3px;
    background-color: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
</style>
